+     * measure: running text is set to a measure, so it fills 0.55-1.00 of its band and carries
+     * 3.5 words or more per line; a value column fills 0.40 or less and holds one or two words.
+     * Measured on this corpus the two populations do not overlap, so the thresholds sit in an
+     * empty band. Both sides must hold four lines and overlap vertically by half the shorter
+     * one, which is what keeps a footnote block, a sidebar or a footer from being called a
